    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You draw upon your knowledge of the Banshee, reshaping your vocal cords into a monstrous approximation of its spectral wail. You unleash a bone-chilling keening cry that pierces the mind of all who hear it. Each creature in the area must attempt a Fortitude saving throw, taking 8d8 mental damage on a failure.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3}.</p>"
